      "description": "Temporary Position Applicant Pool Salary Depends on Qualifications Location 940 Second St. Portsmouth, OH 45662, OH Job Type Temporary Job Number 111 Division Academic and Student Affairs Opening Date 05/17/2023 Description Benefits Job Description Summary This applicant pool is for applicants who have been directed to submit an application by a search chair or hiring official. Principal Duties and Responsibilities This applicant pool is only for individuals who have been pre-notified by a hiring official to submit an application. If you have any questions, please contact Beth Lansky, Talent Management Administrator, at 740-351-3481. Minimum Job Knowledge, Skills and Abilities Vary depending on position. Minimum Qualifications Must be directed to submit application. Qualifications vary based on position and will be discussed by the hiring manager or official. This position is not eligible for benefits. Employer Shawnee State University (OH) Address 940 Second St. Portsmouth, Ohio, 45662 Phone 740-351-3481 Apply"
